// Azure Resource Graph inventory query.
// Run in Resource Graph Explorer or `az graph query -q @inventory.kql --first 1000`.
// Portal CSV export caps at 55,000 rows; script with paging (--skip-token) beyond that.
// Sanitize before committing:
//   python3 scripts/inventory.py --sanitize-arg-csv <export.csv> \
//       --out-csv registry/azure-resources.snapshot.csv
Resources
| project subscriptionId, resourceGroup, name, type, location, id, tags
| order by type asc, name asc
